1	//! GLM5.2 engine surface (TP4 replicated, EP4..EP64 free-running).
2	//!
3	//! Startup validates the official GLM5.2 FP8 checkpoint layout, loads rank
4	//! slices to GPU memory (the non-expert stack replicated to every rank,
5	//! experts placed into their packed layout at H2D time), builds the resident
6	//! models, and serves generation with one autonomous engine per logical DP
7	//! rank: every engine steps its rank unconditionally (idle ranks enter with
8	//! padding rows) and the per-MoE-layer DeepEP collectives pair by entry
9	//! count under the conservative protocol-max bound.
